-- So this replaces the wording of fifteen steps with the book-s, splits the
-- combined Dhyanam & Avahanam step so that the Dora Sthapanam can sit between
-- them where the book puts it, and swaps the fifteen-limb anga pooja for the
-- book-s twenty-four. 29 steps become 31.
